# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The vendor trees. Each is a directory the replicator supplies (README, "Data
# requirements") and none is redistributable from here: marcap is a clone of a
# public archive, fnguide a paid DataGuide export, finmind a FinMind download.
# The panels they produce are committed under data/cache/, so every published
# table and figure reproduces with all three absent. The two small trees beside
# them are committed, because nothing outside this repository supplies them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/external/*
!data/external/registry/
!data/external/krx_supplement/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pipeline intermediates: written by reproduce.sh, read by no test, no figure,
# and no parameter macro. They are regenerated from data/cache/ by the stage
# that owns them, so they are working-directory files rather than published
# artifacts. Every artifact the paper chain DOES open stays tracked.
#
# To re-derive this list after a pipeline change, trace the opens of
#   pytest test_assertions.py, scripts/generate_params.py, generate_figures.py
# and subtract the result from `git ls-files data`; anything the trace never
# opened belongs here. Do not hand-edit: a stale entry silently untracks a
# published artifact.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/min_valid_fraction_sensitivity/F0.7/
data/min_valid_fraction_sensitivity/F0.8/
